WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:47.875
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:51.916
Lord Krishna described the appropriate 
place and seat for yoga.

3
00:00:51.916 --> 00:00:53.875
Now in these two verses,

4
00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:56.791
he is shedding light on the process of yoga.

5
00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:03.458
In these two verses, Lord Krishna 

6
00:01:03.458 --> 00:01:09.833
gives  a detailed description of the mental state
and physical state necessary for yoga.

7
00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:12.333
In the thirteenth verse, Lord Krishna says

8
00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:13.916
that the yogi must keep the body,

9
00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:17.500
head, and neck stable in a straight line,

10
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:18.500
and fix their gaze

11
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.625
on the tip of their nose.

12
00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:26.541
It's essential that their attention
 doesn't wander here and there.

13
00:01:26.541 --> 00:01:27.708
Then in the fourteenth

14
00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:29.375
verse, he explains

15
00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:32.500
that the yogi should have a 
calm and fear-free mind

16
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.875
following the vow of brahmacharya

17
00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:37.208
and should keep his mind in control.

18
00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:40.958
And then, considering Lord Krishna
 alone as their supreme goal,

19
00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:44.083
they must focus this mind on Him alone.

20
00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:45.916
In simple language,

21
00:01:45.916 --> 00:01:49.291
these verses emphasize
 not only physical posture

22
00:01:49.291 --> 00:01:53.791
but also inner control and discipline.

23
00:01:53.791 --> 00:01:56.500
By controlling their body and mind,

24
00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.875
a yogi can focus on the purpose of finding 
Lord Krishna within themselves,

25
00:01:59.875 --> 00:02:02.833
who resides in the heart
 in the form of Paramātmā.

26
00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:06.166
And can remain focused on this goal.

27
00:02:06.166 --> 00:02:09.708
Many people consider yoga only as exercise,

28
00:02:09.708 --> 00:02:11.083
but this is wrong.

29
00:02:11.083 --> 00:02:12.250
Yoga is a path

30
00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.458
that leads to a deep spiritual experience.

31
00:02:15.458 --> 00:02:17.583
And a disciplined yogi,

32
00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:21.000
even amidst all the difficulties
 and entanglements of life,

33
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.333
can move toward inner peace

34
00:02:22.333 --> 00:02:25.500
and spiritual progress.

35
00:02:30.208 --> 00:02:32.041
Along with the appropriate place

36
00:02:32.041 --> 00:02:37.083
and correct physical posture for yoga,

37
00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:40.916
controlling the mind is also extremely essential.

38
00:02:40.916 --> 00:02:45.791
After all, victory must be
 gained over this restless mind,

39
00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:53.625
because this same mind keeps making a 
person wander here and there every moment.

40
00:02:53.625 --> 00:02:55.833
In today's modern age,

41
00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:58.458
this problem has increased further.

42
00:02:58.458 --> 00:03:00.625
Today a person, at any moment,

43
00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:04.791
is connected to the entire world

44
00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:07.375
through just this small phone.

45
00:03:07.375 --> 00:03:11.000
This facility has certainly made life easier,

46
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.125
but at the same time, it has also

47
00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:18.500
created countless opportunities
for the mind to wander.

48
00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:22.083
You sit down to do some important work,

49
00:03:22.083 --> 00:03:23.750
and one sound from the phone,

50
00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.791
just one message from someone,

51
00:03:25.791 --> 00:03:29.250
and unknowingly attention breaks,

52
00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:34.666
and then who knows how much time you waste.

53
00:03:34.666 --> 00:03:38.541
This must have happened with you too, right?

54
00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:41.125
Therefore it's essential

55
00:03:41.125 --> 00:03:45.541
that you learn to keep the mind controlled.

56
00:03:45.541 --> 00:03:49.208
If attention wanders every little while,

57
00:03:49.208 --> 00:03:51.916
you won't be able to focus

58
00:03:51.916 --> 00:03:54.791
on life's important tasks.

59
00:03:54.791 --> 00:03:59.458
Yoga teaches the method of keeping 
the mind concentrated.

60
00:03:59.458 --> 00:04:03.333
And even if you're not doing yoga,

61
00:04:03.333 --> 00:04:07.166
yoga's principles will be extremely helpful.

62
00:04:07.166 --> 00:04:10.625
Understand this.

63
00:04:10.625 --> 00:04:14.458
What are these principles of yoga?

64
00:04:14.458 --> 00:04:17.625
Proper place, physical posture,

65
00:04:17.625 --> 00:04:21.083
designated time, and discipline.

66
00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:23.666
All of these are necessary not only for yoga

67
00:04:23.666 --> 00:04:30.208
but also for important tasks of daily life.

68
00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:32.166
Proper place –

69
00:04:32.166 --> 00:04:35.666
when you sit down to do some important work,

70
00:04:35.666 --> 00:04:38.166
keep cleanliness around you,

71
00:04:38.166 --> 00:04:41.250
things shouldn't be scattered here and there.

72
00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:45.000
This way attention won't wander.

73
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:49.041
Along with proper place, designated time –

74
00:04:49.041 --> 00:04:55.250
for example, if you’re regularly doing 
some professional work at home,

75
00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:59.541
then designate both place and time.

76
00:04:59.541 --> 00:05:02.958
Then as you start sitting at that fixed place

77
00:05:02.958 --> 00:05:07.041
and at that fixed time,

78
00:05:07.041 --> 00:05:11.041
practice of mental concentration will 
automatically start happening.

79
00:05:11.041 --> 00:05:14.375
Correct physical posture,

80
00:05:14.375 --> 00:05:16.916
sitting with a straight back,

81
00:05:16.916 --> 00:05:20.083
is not only about yoga.

82
00:05:20.083 --> 00:05:23.000
This keeps you alert,

83
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.000
which has a positive effect

84
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.333
on daily tasks.

85
00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:30.875
And yes, discipline –

86
00:05:30.875 --> 00:05:40.583
during important times, keep your 
attention-distracting devices away too. 

87
00:05:40.583 --> 00:05:45.500
For some time without these
 devices, life won't stop.

88
00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.916
Yoga and yoga's principles

89
00:05:47.916 --> 00:05:50.583
are always useful for life.

90
00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:52.750
Keep this in mind.

91
00:05:57.208 --> 00:06:04.958
Today in society, many concepts
 related to yoga have arisen.

92
00:06:04.958 --> 00:06:08.583
The word "yoga" is very popular,

93
00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:11.166
but most people understand it

94
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:12.916
only as limited to physical postures

95
00:06:12.916 --> 00:06:17.000
or the process of breathing.

96
00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.875
Yes! Both of these are necessary,

97
00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:26.750
but the real essence of yoga is
 self-control and inner discipline.

98
00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:31.791
In the Bhagavad Gita, yoga is 
not limited only to the body.

99
00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:34.166
Rather, control of mind, senses,

100
00:06:34.166 --> 00:06:41.208
and desires is described as its integral part.

101
00:06:41.208 --> 00:06:44.875
When a person doesn't waste their energy,

102
00:06:44.875 --> 00:06:48.750
and applies it in the direction 
of spiritual advancement,

103
00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:54.541
only then is the full power of yoga experienced.

104
00:06:54.541 --> 00:06:56.833
Today in society, many people

105
00:06:56.833 --> 00:07:00.375
claim to practice complete yoga,

106
00:07:00.375 --> 00:07:04.500
also expect its fruit, but

107
00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.916
if rules and discipline are 
not brought into lifestyle,

108
00:07:07.916 --> 00:07:10.625
then yoga practice is incomplete.

109
00:07:10.625 --> 00:07:12.708
If you want to get the complete fruit of yoga,

110
00:07:12.708 --> 00:07:15.000
then complete practice must be done.

111
00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.166
Think – if an athlete

112
00:07:18.166 --> 00:07:21.041
forgets some things from 
their training requirements,

113
00:07:21.041 --> 00:07:25.041
like balanced diet, regular exercise,

114
00:07:25.041 --> 00:07:28.625
proper morale, etc.,

115
00:07:28.625 --> 00:07:32.041
and doesn't follow them,

116
00:07:32.041 --> 00:07:35.541
can they become the best?

117
00:07:35.541 --> 00:07:37.125
No, right?

118
00:07:37.125 --> 00:07:39.000
For best capacity,

119
00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.708
complete practice must be done.

120
00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:43.375
All rules must be adopted.

121
00:07:43.375 --> 00:07:47.541
This same principle applies to yoga too.

122
00:07:47.541 --> 00:07:51.958
If yoga is limited only to exercise,

123
00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:55.083
then you won't be able to 
obtain the divine knowledge

124
00:07:55.083 --> 00:07:58.875
and spiritual balance available from it.

125
00:07:58.875 --> 00:08:02.750
If you consider spiritual development important,

126
00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:10.000
physically, mentally, and spiritually.

127
00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:14.166
Only then can you experience the true spiritual

128
00:08:14.166 --> 00:08:16.708
benefits of yoga.

129
00:08:21.208 --> 00:08:25.583
In yoga, straight posture, proper environment,

130
00:08:25.583 --> 00:08:28.791
designated time, and discipline are essential.

131
00:08:28.791 --> 00:08:32.041
And these same elements are also important

132
00:08:32.041 --> 00:08:34.916
for progress and success in professional life.

133
00:08:34.916 --> 00:08:37.166
First thing – straight posture,

134
00:08:37.166 --> 00:08:39.833
meaning proper physical condition.

135
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:42.500
If you sit properly straight,

136
00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.625
the mind will remain awake and alert.

137
00:08:45.625 --> 00:08:50.750
But if you develop the bad habit of sitting in a 
lazy posture, hunched over,

138
00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:54.208
then not only will the body tire, 
but the mind will also become lazy.

139
00:08:54.208 --> 00:08:58.583
Attention will wander, concentration will be lost.

140
00:08:58.583 --> 00:08:59.791
So whenever you sit

141
00:08:59.791 --> 00:09:04.125
at your workplace, sit straight, alertly.

142
00:09:04.125 --> 00:09:07.166
This small change will give you strength,

143
00:09:07.166 --> 00:09:12.000
and fatigue will be less even 
after working continuously.

144
00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:15.208
Second thing – proper environment.

145
00:09:15.208 --> 00:09:17.458
If the environment is scattered,

146
00:09:17.458 --> 00:09:19.458
attention will also scatter.

147
00:09:19.458 --> 00:09:21.041
Just like in yoga,

148
00:09:21.041 --> 00:09:22.375
at the workplace too

149
00:09:22.375 --> 00:09:25.041
keep your place clean, keep it organized.

150
00:09:25.041 --> 00:09:27.166
Keep it organized.

151
00:09:27.166 --> 00:09:29.625
Third thing – discipline.

152
00:09:29.625 --> 00:09:33.458
Keeping the workplace organized also means

153
00:09:33.458 --> 00:09:36.541
use the phone in a disciplined manner.

154
00:09:36.541 --> 00:09:40.166
If work is important, keep the phone away,

155
00:09:40.166 --> 00:09:42.583
otherwise time will be wasted.

156
00:09:42.583 --> 00:09:43.708
Remember,

157
00:09:43.708 --> 00:09:45.416
for concentration in work,

158
00:09:45.416 --> 00:09:48.750
along with willpower, these small

159
00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:52.041
habits are also extremely important.

160
00:09:52.041 --> 00:09:55.000
Straight posture, organized environment,

161
00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:58.000
discipline – all these things together

162
00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.833
will help you become concentrated,

163
00:10:00.833 --> 00:10:02.583
which will have a direct effect

164
00:10:02.583 --> 00:10:05.708
on your professional progress.

165
00:10:05.708 --> 00:10:12.166
Don't ignore these seemingly small things.
